@startuml
actor MerchantApp as "Merchant Application"
participant API as "Payment Provider API (Emulator)"
database DB as "Payment Provider DB"
participant ExtNet as "External Test Service"
=== Payouts ==
MerchantApp -> API: POST /api/v1/payouts (Basic Auth)
activate API
  API -> API: Authenticate merchant
  API -> API: Validate request data
  API -> DB: INSERT into payout (status=PENDING)
  API <-- DB: new payout record (ID)
  API -> MerchantApp: 201 Created (status=PENDING)
deactivate API

=== Async later ==

loop Retry up to 3 times if Http status 503 exponential backoff
ExtNet -> API: POST /webhook/payout ({id, status="SUCCESS|FAILED"})

activate API

API -> API: Authenticate webhook
alt auth failed
    API --> ExtNet: Http status (401)
end
group transaction
    API -> DB: get payout by id
    DB --> API: Payout
    alt Выплата не найдена
        API --> ExtNet: Http status (404)
    else Если выплата в конечном статусе, и он отличается от статуса в запросе
        API --> ExtNet: Http status (400)
    else Если выплата уже в этом статусе
        API --> ExtNet: Http status (200)
    end
    API -> DB: UPDATE payout.status = SUCCESS|FAILED
    API -> DB: INSERT into webhooks (entity_id, payload, entity_type)
end
alt success
    API --> ExtNet: HTTP status (200)
else  failed
    API --> ExtNet: HTTP status (503)
end
deactivate API
end
@enduml